    HeckeCharacterZeroLocus.SiegelWeilU.SiegelWeilUnitaryConvergent → Formalism.L2.SG.NGAnalytic.StepChoiceConstantsC →
      Formalism.L2.SG.Pf.BDat.StepThmBG → Formalism.L2.SG.RowsPos.RowNGP →
